  - planning support system
  - air quality
abstract: >-
  TODSphere is browser-based research software for open-data screening of transit-oriented
  development. It computes seven indicators covering transit accessibility, built density,
  land-use diversity, walkability, amenity accessibility, green space and near-road
  air-quality screening, aggregates them into Node, Place, People and Ecology dimensions,
  and provides composite scores, ranking and robustness diagnostics.
